[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0637","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0637.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21174","title":"Microsoft Windows Standards-Based Storage Management Service 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 基于标准的存储管理服务（Standards-Based Storage Management Service）存在不受控制的资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需用户交互即可通过网络向目标服务发送特制请求，触发服务端资源耗尽，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21174"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-08T18:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 4 月安全更新，各版本对应修复版本号：Windows Server 2012 R2 升级至 6.3.9600.22523 及以上，Windows Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7969 及以上，Windows Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.7136 及以上，Windows Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3453 及以上，Windows Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3775 及以上。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或访问 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面限制对 Windows Standards-Based Storage Management Service（端口 47000/TCP）的未授权网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21174","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2025/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21174.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21174"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0637.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0847","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0847.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21384","title":"Microsoft Azure Health Bot 服务端请求伪造导致特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Azure Health Bot 存在服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞，经过身份认证的攻击者可利用该漏洞向内部网络资源发送特制请求，绕过安全机制实现权限提升。该漏洞源于对用户输入的 URL 验证不充分，导致攻击者能够以服务端身份访问内部系统。影响范围包括 Azure Health Bot 服务相关部署，CVSS 评分 8.3，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有有效凭据方可利用，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 4 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21384"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-04-01T01:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:43:15Z","remediation":"立即登录 Azure 门户，确认 Azure Health Bot 服务实例已自动更新至最新版本（Microsoft 已于服务端修复此 SSRF 漏洞，无需手动打补丁）。在 Azure 门户中导航至 Health Bot 实例的\"网络\"设置，启用\"受信任服务\"访问限制，配置出站网络规则仅允许访问白名单内端点，并禁用不必要的内部 API 调用权限以降低 SSRF 影响面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21384","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21384.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2025/CVE-2025-21384.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-213xx/CVE-2025-21384.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21384.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0847.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0622","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0622.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1861","title":"PHP HTTP流包装器重定向位置截断漏洞","description":"PHP 的流 HTTP 包装器（stream HTTP wrapper）在处理 HTTP 重定向响应时存在缓冲区大小计算错误（CWE-131），location 值缓冲区被限制为 1024 字节，而 RFC 9110 建议上限为 8000 字节。远程攻击者可通过构造超长重定向 URL，使 PHP 截断 location 值并跳转到错误地址，导致应用逻辑绕过或非预期重定向。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.32 之前、8.2.28 之前、8.3.19 之前及 8.4.5 之前的版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1861"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-30T06:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:55Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 8.1.32、8.2.28、8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本，这些版本已将 HTTP 重定向 Location 缓冲区从 1024 字节扩展至 8000 字节以符合 RFC 9110 规范。该漏洞无有效临时缓解措施，必须通过版本升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-52jp-hrpf-2jff","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0005/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1861.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2025/CVE-2025-1861.md","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1861.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1861.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2025-1861-2025-05-23-1205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0622.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0618","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1736","title":"PHP Stream HTTP Wrapper 标头验证不足导致基本认证头遗漏漏洞","description":"PHP 流式 HTTP 包装器在处理用户提供的 HTTP 标头时，对行尾字符的验证存在不足。当应用程序通过 PHP 的流式 HTTP 包装器发送包含用户可控内容的 HTTP 标头时，攻击者可通过注入特殊构造的行尾字符，导致部分标头（如 Basic Authentication 授权标头）被省略或错误解析。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.32 之前、8.2.28 之前、8.3.19 之前及 8.4.5 之前的所有版本。成功利用该漏洞可能导致身份验证绕过，使攻击者无需凭据即可访问受保护的资源。CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1736"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-30T06:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:41Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至以下修复版本：PHP 8.1.x 升级到 8.1.32 及以上，PHP 8.2.x 升级到 8.2.28 及以上，PHP 8.3.x 升级到 8.3.19 及以上，PHP 8.4.x 升级到 8.4.5 及以上。若无法立即升级，可通过禁用 PHP 配置中不必要的 stream HTTP wrapper（如 php.ini 中设置 allow_url_fopen=Off）作为临时缓解措施，并检查所有传入 HTTP 请求头中的换行符（CRLF），过滤或拒绝包含异常换行序列的请求头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-hgf5-96fm-v528","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0006/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1736.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f8f41b3c8a1114b748f2f7bb00dbfa68417789/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1736.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1736.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2025-1736-2025-05-23-1205","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-1736"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0616","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1734","title":"PHP HTTP Streams 包装器输入验证不当漏洞","description":"PHP Streams HTTP 包装器在处理来自 HTTP 服务器的响应头时存在输入验证缺陷。当响应头缺少冒号分隔符时，包装器未将其识别为无效头，而是当作合法头传递给应用程序处理，导致应用程序可能接受不符合 HTTP 协议规范的非法头。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.32 之前、8.2.28 之前、8.3.19 之前及 8.4.5 之前的所有版本。攻击条件要求攻击者能够控制或劫持 PHP 应用所连接的 HTTP 服务器返回的响应头，例如通过中间人攻击或恶意后端服务返回包含无效头的响应。由于 PHP 应用通常依赖响应头进行业务逻辑判断（如重定向、认证、缓存控制等），攻击者可构造缺少冒号的畸形头绕过某些安全校验或干扰应用正常流程。利用方式无需身份认证，攻击者通过中间人位置或代理后端返回畸形 HTTP 响应头即可触发，造成低级别的数据完整性问题。PHP 官方已在 8.1.32、8.2.28、8.3.19 及 8.4.5 版本中修复此问题，建议受影响用户及时升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1734"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-30T06:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:41Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至以下修复版本：PHP 8.1 系列升级到 8.1.32，PHP 8.2 系列升级到 8.2.28，PHP 8.3 系列升级到 8.3.19，PHP 8.4 系列升级到 8.4.5。在升级前，可在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面配置请求头过滤规则，拒绝缺少冒号的无效 HTTP 请求头，以临时降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-pcmh-g36c-qc44","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0009/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1734.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1babb409c908ee5fdab519495238fe03dea56d31/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d6db6ddfb07ef853c79bb625eb614ba3cefe7aaf/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1734.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1734.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1734.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2025-1734-2025-05-23-1205","https://github.com/WolfThere/cve_2025-1734"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0616.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0505","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1219","title":"PHP libxml DOM 和 SimpleXML 扩展 HTTP 重定向时内容类型标头处理不当漏洞","description":"PHP 的 DOM 和 SimpleXML 扩展在通过 libxml 流请求 HTTP 资源时，当目标资源发生重定向（redirect），会使用错误的内容类型（Content-Type）头来确定返回文档的字符编码。这导致解析器使用错误的字符集解析文档，可能造成 XML/HTML 文档被错误解析，从而绕过安全验证机制。攻击者可通过构造特制的重定向响应，诱导 PHP 应用错误解析文档内容，绕过输入验证或安全策略。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.32 之前、8.2.28 之前、8.3.19 之前及 8.4.5 之前的多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1219"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-30T06:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:37Z","remediation":"建议立即将 PHP 升级至 8.1.32、8.2.28、8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本。如使用源码编译，可从 php.net 下载最新版本重新编译安装；如使用包管理器，CentOS/RHEL 执行 `yum update php`，Ubuntu/Debian 执行 `apt update && apt upgrade php`。若无法立即升级，可在应用层对 HTTP 重定向响应手动校验 Content-Type 头部的 charset 参数，拒绝非预期的字符集声明。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-p3x9-6h7p-cgfc","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0007/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1219.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2025/CVE-2025-1219.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1219.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1219.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12199.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12198.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1219.json","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php80-cve-2025-1219.patch","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php742-cve-2025-1219.patch","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1219.md","https://github.com/BreadSquad/ediop3PHP"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0504","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1217","title":"PHP HTTP流包装器折叠标头解析不当漏洞","description":"PHP HTTP 流包装器（http stream wrapper）的标头解析器在处理 HTTP 响应时未能正确处理折叠标头（folded headers），导致响应解析错误。攻击者可通过构造包含折叠标头的恶意 HTTP 响应，使 PHP 应用程序误解析响应内容，从而使用错误的标头、MIME 类型等信息，可能绕过安全策略或导致信息泄露。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.32 之前、8.2.28 之前、8.3.19 之前及 8.4.5 之前的版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，但攻击复杂度较高（需控制 HTTP 服务器或中间人攻击），CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1217"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-29T06:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:37Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 8.1.32、8.2.28、8.3.19 或 8.4.5 及以上版本。Debian 用户可参考 debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014 应用安全更新。NetApp 用户参考 ntap-20250523-0008 安装对应补丁。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 HTTP 响应头进行严格校验，过滤包含折叠空白字符（如换行后空格/制表符）的头部字段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-v8xr-gpvj-cx9g","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00014.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0008/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1217.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1217.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1217.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1217.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2025-1217-2025-05-23-1205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0442","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0442.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1098","title":"Kubernetes ingress-nginx 配置注入漏洞","description":"Kubernetes ingress-nginx 控制器中存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），攻击者可通过向 Ingress 资源添加恶意的 `mirror-target` 和 `mirror-host` 注解，向 nginx 配置中注入任意指令。具有 Ingress 资源创建或更新权限的已认证攻击者利用该漏洞可在 ingress-nginx 容器上下文中执行任意代码，并窃取控制器可访问的 Secrets（默认安装下控制器可访问集群所有命名空间的 Secrets）。该漏洞影响所有 ingress-nginx 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。官方已在 1.11.5 和 1.12.1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1098"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-25T00:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:22Z","remediation":"立即将 ingress-nginx 控制器升级至 v1.11.5 或 v1.12.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，通过 Kubernetes 准入控制器（Admission Controller）或 OPA/Gatekeeper 策略禁止使用 `mirror-target` 和 `mirror-host` 注解，并限制 ingress-nginx 控制器对集群 Secrets 的 RBAC 访问权限，仅授予必要的命名空间读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/131008","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0008/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52475","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1098.yaml","https://github.com/lufeirider/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1098.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1098.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1098.json","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/ingress-nginx/CVE-2025-1974/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-1098.rules","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/57683729c2eb2a75a14fa2823541d987be4efb2b/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-05-27-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/garden-io/garden/blob/4e7128de8dfb5f38f76a5d005a65a78110be7553/docs/misc/nginx-vulnerability.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2025/CVE-2025-1097.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/k8s.io/ingress-nginx/CVE-2025-1098.yml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-1098","https://github.com/hakaioffsec/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/Esonhugh/ingressNightmare-CVE-2025-1974-exps"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0442.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0442.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0442.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0009","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1974","title":"Kubernetes ingress-nginx 准入控制器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Kubernetes 的 ingress-nginx 准入控制器（Validating Admission Webhook）存在远程代码执行漏洞。在特定条件下，位于 Pod 网络内且无需身份认证的攻击者，可通过向准入控制器暴露的接口发送特制的 AdmissionReview 请求，利用控制器配置校验逻辑中的缺陷注入并执行任意代码，从而在 ingress-nginx 控制器进程上下文中实现远程代码执行。由于默认安装中该控制器可访问集群内全部 Secret，攻击者可借此读取并泄露这些敏感凭据，造成严重的信息泄露与权限提升风险。该漏洞影响未修复的 ingress-nginx 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8（严重）。攻击前提是攻击者能够访问集群的 Pod 网络（如已突破边界进入内部网络或存在暴露的入口）。官方建议升级至 1.12.1 及以上或 1.11.5 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1974"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-25T00:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:27Z","remediation":"立即将 ingress-nginx 升级至 1.11.5 或 1.12.1 及以上版本（1.10.x 及更早版本无修复需整体升级）。若无法立即升级，应在网络层面限制对准入 Webhook 服务（默认 8443 端口，ValidatingWebhookConfiguration 指向的 Service）的访问，仅允许 kube-apiserver 来源 IP 访问，禁止 Pod 网络或未授权主机直连；同时通过 NetworkPolicy 或防火墙隔离 ingress-nginx 控制器 Pod 的网络，并收紧其 ServiceAccount 权限，避免控制器读取集群内全部 Secret 造成横向泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/131009","https://github.com/B1ack4sh/Blackash-CVE-2025-1974","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0008/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52475","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52338","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/lufeirider/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/m-q-t/ingressnightmare-detection-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/ingress-nginx/CVE-2025-1974/README.md","https://github.com/kubernetes/website/blob/2582ebe04be71406110a3960a6d16f991a89921d/content/ja/blog/_posts/2025/ingress-nginx-cve-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%BA%91%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Kubernetes%20Ingress-nginx%20admission%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/yandex-cloud/docs/blob/47ef534f5e9072b4d738c6292d74938e29bac8d9/ru/_includes/security/security-bulletins/cve-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1974.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-04/Kubernetes%20CVE-2025-1974%20RCE.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/5cf36cd0d4ae46fc3e8539fa2825c78bb5f257c2/data/2025/CVE-2025-1974-zwxxb_CVE-2025-1974.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9f792687ed156d63344016f8bf658946079fb494/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-1974.yaml","https://github.com/hakaioffsec/IngressNightmare-PoC","https://github.com/Esonhugh/ingressNightmare-CVE-2025-1974-exps","https://github.com/sandumjacob/IngressNightmare-POCs","https://github.com/yoshino-s/CVE-2025-1974","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-1974"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0015","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-29927","title":"Vercel Next.js 中间件认证绕过漏洞","description":"Next.js 中间件存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-285/863），攻击者通过在请求中构造恶意的 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头，可绕过中间件中的权限检查逻辑，直接访问本应受保护的内部路由。该漏洞影响 Next.js 全系版本（1.11.4 至 12.3.5/13.5.9/14.2.25/15.2.3 之前版本），所有依赖中间件进行鉴权的 Next.js 应用均受影响。CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。修复方式为升级至安全版本或在 Web 服务器层（如 WAF/Nginx）过滤 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-29927"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-03-21T15:15:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:05:53Z","remediation":"升级到 Next.js 12.3.5+ / 13.5.9+ / 14.2.25+ / 15.2.3+ 或更高版本；如无法立即升级，在 Nginx/Apache/WAF 层配置规则拦截并删除外部请求中的 `x-middleware-subrequest` 请求头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/52a078da3884efe6501613c7834a3d02a91676d2","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/5fd3ae8f8542677c6294f32d18022731eab6fe48","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v12.3.5","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v13.5.9","https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-f82v-jwr5-mffw","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/23/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/23/4","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0002/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52124","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-29927.yaml","https://github.com/Nayekah/Next.js-Proof-of-Concept","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-29927.md","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/CVE-mitre/blob/ac449b44513bd2f0f30db8cbb4c005f5fa38861e/2025/CVE-2025-29927/README.MD","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-29927/README.md","https://github.com/AC-UVC/ARL-ADD-POC/blob/6c052f1c7c726184e0c6325dcf3593f358af7b66/poc/CVE-2025-29927.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2af0d4e6821c2bba628b60025f4ebdb092ca487e/references/CVE-2025-29927-2025-06-07-1805","https://github.com/moyshik7/vul-detector/blob/a5de9b36f7e5bbb96f345b67a2ed54c204298eeb/cves/CVE-2025-29927.js","https://github.com/Oyst3r1ng/CVE-2025-29927/blob/ce976387acd35f5c6a07783f8531890c3bcd97e7/Poc_CVE-2025-29927.py","https://github.com/ARESHAmohanad/rooms/blob/603aa5bc9064039eefc3af86d1baefb7ba8dfdf1/next.js%20cve-2025-29927.txt","https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/blob/3cfcb53d9b64f662d864c10bc7a8c2c0a99fe2ea/CHANGES.md","https://github.com/narwalsguy/CVE-and-vuln-fixes/blob/9daa242594c7562cae728afea291a208ddda13c1/CVE-2025-29927%20Next.js","https://github.com/aydinnyunus/CVE-2025-29927","https://github.com/AnonKryptiQuz/NextSploit","https://github.com/websecnl/CVE-2025-29927-PoC-Exploit","https://github.com/6mile/nextjs-CVE-2025-29927","https://github.com/azu/nextjs-cve-2025-29927-poc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-29927"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0398","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0495","title":"Docker buildx 缓存后端配置密钥泄露到遥测端点漏洞","description":"Docker Buildx 的缓存后端配置支持通过设置属性值的方式传递凭据，当用户将敏感凭据作为 cache-to/cache-from 配置的属性值输入时，这些安全值可能被 OpenTelemetry 追踪功能捕获并记录到遥测端点中，导致凭据泄露。该漏洞影响使用 Buildx 缓存后端配置传递凭据的场景，攻击者需要具备本地访问权限并诱导用户执行特定操作才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.1，危害等级中危。此漏洞不影响通过环境变量或注册表认证方式传递给 GitHub 缓存后端的凭据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0495"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-17T20:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:35Z","remediation":"立即将 Docker buildx 升级至 v0.21.3 或更高版本（当前最新版为 v0.35.0），可通过 `docker buildx upgrade` 或从 GitHub Releases 页面下载替换二进制文件。如无法立即升级，应避免在 `cache-to/cache-from` 配置的 CLI 参数中直接传递凭据值，改用环境变量或 registry 认证方式传递；同时确保 OpenTelemetry 追踪数据及 BuildKit 守护进程历史记录仅存储在受控安全环境中，防止凭据泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/docker/buildx","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0495.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0495.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0495.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0495","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/docker/buildx/CVE-2025-0495.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0495.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0495.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2025-3527.yaml","https://github.com/deckhouse/deckhouse/blob/9d39f1848d168e946d608414ae20f10498e23eed/modules/002-deckhouse/images/init/known_vulnerabilities.vex","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-0495.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0620","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1767","title":"Kubernetes gitRepo 卷本地仓库访问控制漏洞","description":"Kubernetes 内置的 gitRepo 卷插件存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），由于该插件未对 git 仓库来源进行充分的访问控制检查，拥有高权限的攻击者可通过创建挂载 gitRepo 卷的 Pod，访问同一节点上其他 Pod 中的 git 仓库数据，导致敏感信息泄露或数据篡改。该漏洞影响 Kubelet <= v1.32.2 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。由于 in-tree gitRepo 卷功能已被弃用且不再接收上游安全更新，仍在使用该功能的集群将持续面临风险。Kubernetes 官方建议迁移至 CSI 驱动替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1767"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-13T17:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:44Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已弃用的 in-tree gitRepo 卷类型，改用 init 容器执行 git clone 操作并将目录挂载到 Pod 容器中。同时通过 ValidatingAdmissionPolicy 或 Restricted Pod Security Standard 策略禁止 gitRepo 卷的使用，CEL 表达式：`has(object.spec.volumes) && object.spec.volumes.exists(v, has(v.gitRepo))`。如使用 klts-io/kubernetes-lts 发行版，可应用 CVE-2025-1767.patch 补丁，在 git_repo.go 中增加对本地路径（绝对路径、file://、./、../）的校验拒绝逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/130786","https://groups.google.com/g/kubernetes-security-announce/c/19irihsKg7s","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/03/13/9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1767.json","https://github.com/klts-io/kubernetes-lts/blob/9bf470103f363c5e89c7a51ce562037dc10061f7/patches/CVE-2025-1767.patch","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1767.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0706","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21247","title":"Microsoft Windows MapUrlToZone 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows MapUrlToZone 函数存在路径等价性解析不当漏洞（CWE-41），该函数用于将 URL 映射到 Internet、本地 Intranet、受信任站点等安全区域。未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络诱导用户访问特制 URL，利用路径解析缺陷绕过安全区域检查机制，导致本应归入受限区域的 URL 被错误归类为低风险区域，造成机密性低度影响。攻击需用户交互，无需提前获取权限。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 3 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21247"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-11T17:16:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:53Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 3 月安全更新。各受影响版本对应修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20947、Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7876、Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.7009、Windows 10 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5608、Windows 10 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5608、Windows 11 22H2 升级至 10.0.22621.5039、Windows 11 23H2 升级至 10.0.22631.5039、Windows 11 24H2 升级至 10.0.26100.3476、Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3270、Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.3403。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：限制不受信任来源对 URL 解析功能的调用，避免用户从不受信来源打开链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21247","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21247.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2025/CVE-2025-21247.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21247.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21247.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2025/CVE-2025-21247.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0659","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0659.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21199","title":"Microsoft Azure 备份和站点恢复代理安装程序特权提升漏洞","description":"Azure 备份和站点恢复代理安装程序存在权限管理不当漏洞（CWE-269）。本地已授权攻击者需具备低权限并诱使用户执行特定操作，利用安装程序中的权限管理缺陷将自身权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，从而获取对目标系统的高完整性访问能力。该漏洞影响 Azure 备份和站点恢复代理安装程序组件，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中危。成功利用后攻击者可读取敏感数据、安装程序或执行任意操作。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21199"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-11T17:16:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:45Z","remediation":"将 Azure 备份代理升级到 2.0.9940.0 及以上版本，将 Azure Site Recovery 代理升级到 9.30 及以上版本。可在 Azure 门户中通过\"恢复服务保管库\"→\"复制的基础结构\"→\"更新代理\"批量推送更新。如无法立即升级，建议限制本地用户对安装目录的写入权限，并确保仅授权管理员执行代理安装操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21199","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2025/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21199.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21199"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0659.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0642","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0642.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21180","title":"Microsoft Windows exFAT 文件系统远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows exFAT 文件系统驱动中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），由于驱动程序在处理畸形 exFAT 文件系统映像时未正确验证堆内存边界，导致攻击者可通过特制的 exFAT 格式存储设备触发缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者需要诱使用户挂载或访问恶意构造的 exFAT 映像文件，成功利用后可获得目标系统的 SYSTEM 权限，实现权限提升并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21180"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-11T17:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 3 月安全更新。各版本对应修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级到 10.0.10240.20947 及以上、Windows 10 1607 升级到 10.0.14393.7876、Windows 10 1809 升级到 10.0.17763.7009、Windows 10 21H2 升级到 10.0.19044.5608、Windows 10 22H2 升级到 10.0.19045.5608、Windows 11 22H2/23H2 升级到 10.0.22621.5039 或 10.0.22631.5039、Windows 11 24H2 升级到 10.0.26100.3476、Windows Server 2016 升级到 10.0.14393.7876、Windows Server 2019 升级到 10.0.17763.7009、Windows Server 2022 升级到 10.0.20348.3270、Windows Server 2025 升级到 10.0.26100.3403。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：限制用户对 exFAT 格式卷的写入权限，避免打开来自不可信来源的 exFAT 格式存储设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21180","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21180.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2025/CVE-2025-21180.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21180.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21180.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21180"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0642.toml"}]